* VIEW - SCROLL AND SEARCH TEXT

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* VIEW - SCROLL AND SEARCH TEXT

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:VIEW filespec [filespec ...]

Displays text with scrolling and search. Space or period advances a line;
Return or > advances a page; < moves back; B/E goes to the beginning/end;
L/R scrolls horizontally.

G followed by a search string and Return searches the file. A lowercase
search is case-insensitive; uppercase requests an exact case match. Ctrl-X
selects the next file, Ctrl-R the previous file, and Ctrl-C exits. This is
a private alternative to public TYPE/LT.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
